Date: Mon, 13 Oct 2014 11:20:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] sound: soc: Add external devices jack support for
 DB8094

Add external devices jack interrupt support to msm8994
audio machine driver.

Change-Id: Ibc6c4acbc6d2e0ed80a7de9ed47e20bb2c5d9402
Signed-off-by: Tanya Finkel <tfinkel@codeaurora.org>
---
 sound/soc/msm/msm8994.c | 264 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 216 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

